Test: Comparison Operators
--------------------------------------
  10 == 10: 1
  10 == 5: 0
  10 != 5: 1
  10 != 10: 0
  10 < 20: 1
  20 < 10: 0
  10 <= 10: 1
  10 <= 20: 1
  20 > 10: 1
  10 > 20: 0
  10 >= 10: 1
  20 >= 10: 1

String Comparisons:
--------------------------------------
  str1 = 'hello'
  str1 == 'hello': 1
  str1 == 'world': 0
